---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const vueExample = `<script setup lang="ts">...</script>

<template lang="nmbl">
div#app
  header.site-header
    h1 {{ title }}
    nav
      a(href="/home") Home
      a(href="/about") About

  main.content
    article(v-for="post in posts" :key="post.id")
      h2 {{ post.title }}
      p {{ post.excerpt }}
      button(@click="viewPost(post.id)") Read More

  footer
    p © 2024 My Site
</template>

<style scoped>...</style>
`;

const viteConfigExample = `import { defineConfig } from 'vite';
import vue from '@vitejs/plugin-vue';
import nmbl from '@nmbl/vite-plugin';

export default defineConfig({
  plugins: [
    nmbl(),  // must be before vue()
    vue(),
  ],
});`;

const tsconfigExample = `{
  "compilerOptions": {
    // ... your existing options
  },
  "vueCompilerOptions": {
    "plugins": ["@nmbl/vue-language-plugin"]
  }
}`;
---

<BaseLayout title="Vue Integration Guide">
  <section class="guide-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="breadcrumb">
        <a href="/guides">Guides</a> / Vue
      </div>
      <h1>Vue Integration</h1>
      <p class="lead">Use NMBL templates with Vue.js</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="guide-content">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="content-grid">
        <aside class="toc">
          <h3>Contents</h3>
          <nav>
            <a href="#installation">Installation</a>
            <a href="#configuration">Configuration</a>
            <a href="#basic-usage">Basic Usage</a>
            <a href="#differences">Differences from HTML/Pug</a>
            <a href="#intellisense">Intellisense Features</a>
            <a href="#troubleshooting">Troubleshooting</a>
          </nav>
        </aside>

        <div class="prose">
          <h2 id="installation">Installation</h2>

          <p>To use NMBL in Vue projects, you need the Vite plugin (for compilation) and the Vue language plugin (for IDE intellisense):</p>

          <pre><code class="language-bash"># Using npm
npm install --save-dev @nmbl/vite-plugin @nmbl/vue-language-plugin

# Using bun
bun add -d @nmbl/vite-plugin @nmbl/vue-language-plugin

# Using pnpm
pnpm add -D @nmbl/vite-plugin @nmbl/vue-language-plugin</code></pre>

          <h2 id="configuration">Configuration</h2>


          <h3>Vite Config</h3>
          <p>Add the NMBL plugin to your <code>vite.config.ts</code>. It must be listed <strong>before</strong> the Vue plugin:</p>

          <pre><code class="language-ts">{viteConfigExample}</code></pre>
          
          <h3>TypeScript Config</h3>
          <p>Add the NMBL plugin to your <code>tsconfig.json</code> to enable intellisense:</p>

          <pre><code class="language-json">{tsconfigExample}</code></pre>

          <h3>VS Code Setup</h3>
          <p>The NMBL VS Code extension provides syntax highlighting (not yet on the marketplace &mdash; install it from the repo). Vue intellisense works through the Vue - Official extension (Volar).</p>

          <h2 id="basic-usage">Basic Usage</h2>

          <p>Simply add <code>lang="nmbl"</code> to your template blocks:</p>

          <pre><code class="language-vue">{vueExample}</code></pre>

          <h2 id="intellisense">Intellisense Features</h2>

          <p>With the Vue language plugin installed, you get full intellisense support:</p>

          <div class="features-grid">
            <div class="feature">
              <h4>🔍 Go to Definition</h4>
              <p>Click on variables, methods, or components to jump to their definitions</p>
            </div>
            <div class="feature">
              <h4>💡 Auto-completion</h4>
              <p>Get suggestions for props, events, directives, and component names</p>
            </div>
            <div class="feature">
              <h4>🔗 CSS Class Linking</h4>
              <p>Ctrl/Cmd+click on classes to jump to their CSS definitions (scoped styles only)</p>
            </div>
            <div class="feature">
              <h4>❗ Error Highlighting</h4>
              <p>See TypeScript and Vue compiler errors directly in your template</p>
            </div>
            <div class="feature">
              <h4>📝 Hover Information</h4>
              <p>Hover over variables and components to see type information</p>
            </div>
            <div class="feature">
              <h4>♻️ Refactoring</h4>
              <p>Rename variables and have them update across template and script</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <h2 id="troubleshooting">Troubleshooting</h2>

          <div class="troubleshooting">
            <h3>Variables marked as unused</h3>
            <p>Make sure the Vue language plugin is properly configured in your <code>tsconfig.json</code> and restart your IDE.</p>

            <h3>No component auto-import suggestions</h3>
            <p>Currently, you need to type the full component name first. Auto-import will then suggest adding the import statement. This experience is being improved.</p>

            <h3>CSS classes not linking to styles</h3>
            <p>This only works with <code>&lt;style scoped&gt;</code> blocks. This is a Vue/Volar limitation that applies to all template languages, not just NMBL.</p>

            <h3>Syntax errors with indentation</h3>
            <p>Ensure your template starts at column 0 with no leading whitespace. NMBL uses indentation for structure, so the root element must not be indented.</p>

            <h3>Template not compiling</h3>
            <p>Check that you have <code>@nmbl/vite-plugin</code> installed and listed <strong>before</strong> <code>@vitejs/plugin-vue</code> in your Vite config.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="next-steps">
            <h2>Next Steps</h2>
            <div class="next-links">
              <a href="/playground" class="next-link">
                <span>Try the Playground</span>
                <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                  <polyline points="9 18 15 12 9 6"></polyline>
                </svg>
              </a>
              <a href="https://github.com/nmbl-lang/nmbl/tree/main/examples/vue" target="_blank" class="next-link">
                <span>View Example Project</span>
                <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                  <path d="M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"></path>
                  <polyline points="15 3 21 3 21 9"></polyline>
                  <line x1="10" y1="14" x2="21" y2="3"></line>
                </svg>
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .guide-hero {
    padding: 3rem 0;
    background: linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--color-bg-subtle), transparent);
  }

  .breadcrumb {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .breadcrumb a {
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .breadcrumb a:hover {
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }

  .guide-hero h1 {
    font-size: 3rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .lead {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }

  .guide-content {
    padding: 4rem 0;
  }

  .content-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 200px 1fr;
    gap: 4rem;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .toc {
    position: sticky;
    top: 2rem;
  }

  .toc h3 {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .toc nav {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  .toc a {
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    text-decoration: none;
    padding: 0.25rem 0;
    border-left: 2px solid transparent;
    padding-left: 1rem;
    transition: all 0.2s;
  }

  .toc a:hover {
    color: var(--color-text);
    border-left-color: var(--color-accent);
  }

  .prose {
    max-width: 65ch;
  }

  .prose h2 {
    font-size: 2rem;
    margin-top: 3rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    padding-top: 1rem;
  }

  .prose h2:first-child {
    margin-top: 0;
    padding-top: 0;
  }

  .prose h3 {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    margin-top: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .prose h4 {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .prose p {
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }

  .prose ul, .prose ol {
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    padding-left: 2rem;
  }

  .prose li {
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }

  .prose strong {
    color: var(--color-text);
  }

  .prose code {
    background: var(--color-bg-subtle);
    padding: 0.125rem 0.375rem;
    border-radius: 4px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.875em;
  }

  .prose pre {
    background: var(--color-bg-code);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    overflow-x: auto;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .prose pre code {
    background: transparent;
    padding: 0;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .prose table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .prose th {
    text-align: left;
    padding: 0.75rem;
    border-bottom: 2px solid var(--color-border);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .prose td {
    padding: 0.75rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }

  .comparison {
    margin: 2rem 0;
  }

  .comparison h3 {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  .features-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
    gap: 1.5rem;
    margin: 2rem 0;
  }

  .feature {
    padding: 1.5rem;
    background: var(--color-bg-subtle);
    border-radius: 8px;
  }

  .feature h4 {
    margin-top: 0;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .feature p {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
  }

  .troubleshooting {
    margin: 2rem 0;
  }

  .troubleshooting h3 {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .next-steps {
    margin-top: 4rem;
    padding: 2rem;
    background: var(--color-bg-subtle);
    border-radius: 12px;
  }

  .next-steps h2 {
    margin-top: 0;
  }

  .next-links {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .next-link {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
    background: var(--color-bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 8px;
    color: var(--color-text);
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: all 0.2s;
  }

  .next-link:hover {
    border-color: var(--color-accent);
    color: var(--color-accent);
    transform: translateX(2px);
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .guide-hero h1 {
      font-size: 2rem;
    }

    .content-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .toc {
      display: none;
    }
  }
</style>